Major missing piece implemented: connector runtime. ConnectorRegistry.start_all() now called on server startup, spawning telegram long-polling, file watchers, etc. Event loop receives events via mpsc and routes them through new connectors/router.rs module. Direct agent binding: if channel.agent_id is set, events inject into conversations (find or create conversation, send_message). Otherwise events go to connector_events table for workflow engine. New V22 migration adds conversation_channel_bindings table for persistent channel→conversation mapping. Agent ChannelsTab.svelte replaced placeholder with real UI: shows bound channels, available unbound channels, connect/disconnect buttons. Router extracts text from telegram/file_watcher/webhook/generic payloads.
